OL,3,GNEWSAAfroFest aims to 'break down
OL,4,Abarriers' to theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new festival aims to create a "safe
OL,7,Fspace" to encourage people with African
OL,8,For Caribbean heritage to visit the
OL,9,Ftheatre.
OL,11,FSinger Banke Naya, also known as Banke
OL,12,FAdetumbi, set up AfroFest to celebrate
OL,13,Fthe food, music, art and fashion of
OL,14,Fthose communities.
OL,16,F"It is important because it creates a
OL,17,Fbridge; it's an opportunity for
OL,18,FAfrican, Caribbean and black
OL,19,Fcommunities to see themselves reflected
OL,20,Fin the theatre," she said.
